      "title": "Read me",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## KDX – all nodes together\n\n**KDX Wildcard Studio** picks the next template (panel on the left: categories, repeat, Manual/Pin, LLM pill).\n**KDX LLM Chat** rewrites it while the LLM pill is on; with the pill off it passes the prompt on unchanged (Console `llm_enabled` → Chat `llm_enabled`). A category's `system_prompt` profile wins over the instruction in the Chat's `system_prompt` field.\n**KDX Prompt Extractor** takes `rewritten_prompt` and `aspect_ratio` from the LLM answer (or the ratio written in a template) and **KDX AutoRes** turns the ratio into width × height for the model.\n\nSet your LLM server and model in **KDX LLM Client** and your checkpoint in **Load Checkpoint**. Needs ComfyUI-KDX-Wildcard-Studio, ComfyUI-KDX-LLM (0.9.0+) and ComfyUI-KDX-Resolution."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## KDX – all nodes together\n\n**KDX Wildcard Studio** picks the next template (panel on the left: categories, repeat, Manual/Pin, LLM pill).\n**KDX LLM Chat** rewrites it while the LLM pill is on; with the pill off it passes the prompt on unchanged (Console `llm_enabled` → Chat `llm_enabled`). A category's `system_prompt` profile wins over the instruction in the Chat's `system_prompt` field.\n**KDX Prompt Extractor** takes `rewritten_prompt` and `aspect_ratio` from the LLM answer (or the ratio written in a template) and **KDX AutoRes** turns the ratio into width × height for the model.\n\nSet your LLM server and model in **KDX LLM Client** and your checkpoint in **Load Checkpoint**. Needs ComfyUI-KDX-Wildcard-Studio, ComfyUI-KDX-LLM (0.9.0+) and ComfyUI-KDX-Resolution."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
